sequenceDiagram
    actor Ops as Participant / reviewer
    participant CLI as Workshop CLI
    participant K as Kafka
    participant C as Kafka consumer
    participant T as Temporal
    participant W as Worker activities
    participant AI as Gate 1 / inference adapter
    participant MCP as Gate 2 / MCP adapter
    participant OPA as OPA
    participant B as Gate 3 / Core Banking

    Ops->>CLI: emit case-501
    CLI->>K: Publish to flobank.disputes
    K->>C: Deliver dispute event
    C->>T: Start dispute-case-case-501
    T-->>C: Start accepted
    C->>K: Commit offset + 1
    Note over K,T: Commit after durable start acceptance, not after settlement

    T->>W: Schedule read_dispute_ticket
    W->>B: GET /cases/case-501 with API-audience JWT
    B-->>W: Case data
    W-->>T: Ticket-read result recorded
    T->>W: Schedule diagnose_and_propose_resolution
    Note over W: Compiled LangGraph runs inside one activity

    loop Bounded model / read-tool loop
        W->>AI: Chat request with read-tool schemas
        Note over AI: Replay fixtures or live provider inference
        AI-->>W: Tool call or final proposal
        opt Model selects an allowed read
            W->>MCP: get_case or get_account with MCP-audience JWT
            MCP->>OPA: Evaluate identity, tool, arguments
            OPA-->>MCP: Allow or deny
            alt Allowed
                MCP->>B: Exchange MCP token for API-scoped token
                B-->>MCP: API token
                MCP->>B: Authorized banking GET
                B-->>MCP: Case or account data
                MCP-->>W: Successful tool result
            else Denied or policy unavailable
                MCP-->>W: Tool error<br/>no banking read dispatched
            end
        end
    end

    W->>W: Validate proposal and verified read evidence
    W-->>T: Record investigation result
    alt Investigation failed
        Note over T,W: Business result: INVESTIGATION_FAILED<br/>Temporal execution completes<br/>No settlement activity scheduled
    else Valid replay proposal requiring review
        Note over T,W: Business phase: WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL<br/>75000 paise to acc-101<br/>Approval timeout: 24 hours<br/>Temporal status: Running
        Ops->>CLI: query case-501
        CLI->>T: get_status
        T->>W: Dispatch workflow query
        W-->>T: Phase, proposal, approval = null
        T-->>CLI: Query result
        CLI-->>Ops: Show pending proposal
        Note over Ops,T: Worker stop/start and duplicate delivery shown in recovery sequence
        Ops->>CLI: approve or reject case-501
        CLI->>T: human_approval decision signal
        T->>W: Deliver workflow task with recorded decision
        W-->>T: Schedule execute_settlement_and_notify
        T->>W: Dispatch settlement activity
        alt Approved
            W->>B: POST /payments<br/>key settle-dispute-case-501
            B->>B: Apply rules<br/>persist payment and idempotency record
            B-->>W: New payment or existing result on retry
            W->>B: PATCH case-501 status = resolved
            B-->>W: Case-update response
            W-->>T: Settlement activity result
        else Rejected
            W->>B: PATCH case-501 status = closed
            B-->>W: Case-update response
            Note over W,B: No payment POST
            W-->>T: Rejection activity result
        end
        Note over T,W: Final business phase: COMPLETED<br/>Temporal execution completes
        T-->>CLI: Completed workflow result
        CLI-->>Ops: Show result
        Ops->>B: Read case and payments via evidence-check script
        B-->>Ops: Resolved + one payment, or closed + zero payments
    end
